{"id":"word:hebrew:H4405","type":"word","title":"מִלָּה","subtitle":"H4405 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"a word ; collectively, a discourse ; figuratively, a topic","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to מִלָּה (H4405) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-f.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 38 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"מִלָּה (millâh) means a word ; collectively, a discourse ; figuratively, a topic First listed occurrence: 2Sam 23 2."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"מִלָּה","transliteration":"millâh","pronunciation":"mil-law'","strong":"H4405","lemmaId":"hebrew:H4405","partOfSpeech":"n-f","forms":["מִלָּ֑/י","מִלִּֽים","מִלִּ֣ין","מִלִּ֑ין","מִלִּ֣ים"],"morphs":[["HNcfpa",16],["HR/Ncfpa",6],["HNcfpc/Sp1cs",5],["HNcfsc/Sp1cs",4],["HNcfpc/Sp2ms",2],["HC/Ncfsc/Sp3ms",1],["HC/Ncfpa",1],["HR/Ncfsa",1],["HNcfpc/Sp3mp",1],["HNcfsa",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"a word ; collectively, a discourse ; figuratively, a topic","usage":"answer, by-word, matter, any thing (what) to say, to speak(-ing), speak, talking, word.","full":"H4405. millah or milleh מִלָּה noun feminine word, speech, utterance (in poetry, especially Job; common in Aramaic); &#8212; ׳מ Psa 139:4 ; Job 30:9 ; suffix מִלָּתִי 13:17 3 t.; מִלָּתוֺ 2Sam 23:2 ; plural מִלִּים Job 6:26 9 t. (all Job); מִלִּין 4:2 12 t. (all Job); plural suffix מִלָּ֑י 19:23 4 t.; מִלֶּיךָ 4:4 ; Prov 23:9 ; מִלֵּיהֶם Psa 19:5 ; &#8212; word בִּלְשׁוֺנִי in ( on ) my tongue 139:4 ; word (of ׳י ), עַללְֿשׁוֺנִי on my tongue 2Sam 23:2 ; מ ׳שֵׂכֶל Prov 23:9 ; figurative Psa 19:5 (|| קַוָּם ; but read קוֺלָם see Che critical note); elsewhere only Job (34 t.); singular speech, utterance Job 13:17 ; 21:2 ; 24:25 ; 29:22 ; also word = by-word , לְמִלָּה לָהֶם וָאֱהִי 30:9 ; plural words , 4:4 ; 6:26 ; 8:10 ; 12:11 ; 15:3 (|| דָּבָר ), 16:4 ; 19:2 , 23 ; 32:11 , 14 ; 33:1 , 8 ( מ ׳קוֺל ), 34:2-3 , 16 ( מ ׳קוֺל ), 36:2 , 4 ; words of God 23:5 ; words = speech, speaking , יוּכָ֑ל מִי בְּמִלִּין וַעְצֹּר 4:2 , compare 29:9 ; utter words , מִלִּין מִמִּיךָ וְהֹצֵאתָ 15:13 ; מ ׳הִגַּדְתָּ 26:4 ; laysnares for words לְמִלִּין קִנְצֵי תְּשִׂימוּן 18:2 , compare 32:15 מִלִּים מֵהֶם הֶעְתִּיקוּ ; מִלִּים מָלֵתִי 32:18 I am full of words , compare הֲשִׁיבֵנִי אִםיֵֿשׁמִֿלִּין 33:32 ; מִלִּין אֲשִׁיבְךָ 35:4 ; יַכְבִּר מִלִּין בִּבְלִידַֿ֫עַת 35:16 , compare 38:2 .","rootNote":"from 4448 (plural masculine as if from מִלֶּה ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"2Sam 23 2","keyReferences":["2Sam 23 2","Job 4 2","Job 4 4","Job 6 26","Job 8 10","Job 12 11","Job 13 17","Job 15 3"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":38,"occurrences":[{"reference":"2Sam 23 2","book":"2Sam","chapter":23,"verse":2,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/מִלָּת֖/וֹ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncfsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"Job 4 2","book":"Job","chapter":4,"verse":2,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּ֝/מִלִּ֗ין","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfpa"},{"reference":"Job 4 4","book":"Job","chapter":4,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִלֶּ֑י/ךָ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfpc/Sp2ms"},{"reference":"Job 6 26","book":"Job","chapter":6,"verse":26,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִלִּ֣ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfpa"},{"reference":"Job 8 10","book":"Job","chapter":8,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִלִּֽים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfpa"},{"reference":"Job 12 11","book":"Job","chapter":12,"verse":11,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִלִּ֣ין","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfpa"},{"reference":"Job 13 17","book":"Job","chapter":13,"verse":17,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִלָּתִ֑/י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp1cs"},{"reference":"Job 15 3","book":"Job","chapter":15,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ֝/מִלִּ֗ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncfpa"},{"reference":"Job 15 13","book":"Job",